msgid "The skewness of a sample: how lopsided the numbers are around their mean."
msgstr "Die Schiefe einer Stichprobe: wie asymmetrisch die Zahlen um ihren Mittelwert liegen."

#: packages/claudia-computes/src/claudia_computes/functions
